!!! archon/hello.mat
!!! The smallest runnable Archon page.
!!!
!!! This page exists only to prove the build and run contract for Archon: it
!!! compiles as a Matrix book against Anomalous's shared Ny runtime and runs on
!!! nyinterpreter. The finding model, rule engine, and analyzers arrive in later
!!! units (see roadmap.md).

book archon.hello

main returns number begin paragraph
    say "Archon: hello from the shared Anomalous runtime"
    give 0
end paragraph
